 Changelog for package power_interfaces
 ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 
+Forthcoming
+-----------
+* Breaking: replace PowerReading ``power_mw`` (milliwatts) with ``power_w`` (watts).
+* Add PowerReading ``valid``; consumers report NaN when it is false.
+
 0.3.1 (2026-08-14)
 ------------------
 * Document the PowerReading units.
